---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumb from '../components/Breadcrumb.astro';
import { siteName } from '../config/site.config.json';
const copyright = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<BaseLayout title="Terms of Service" description={`Terms of Service for ${siteName} — the rules for using our free in-browser tools.`} canonicalPath="/terms-of-service/">
  <main>
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 pt-6">
      <Breadcrumb items={[{ label: 'Terms of Service' }]} />
    </div>
    <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-8">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500">Effective date: {`${copyright}-01-01`}</p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">1. Acceptance of terms</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 leading-7 text-slate-700">
        By accessing or using {siteName} ("the Service"), you agree to these Terms of Service. If you do not agree,
        please do not use the Service. We may update these terms at any time; the latest version will always be available on this page.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">2. Description of service</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 leading-7 text-slate-700">
        The Service provides free, in-browser tools for converting, compressing, and editing documents, images, audio,
        and video. All processing is performed locally in your browser using client-side technology. The Service does not
        receive, store, or transmit the files you process.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">3. Acceptable use</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 leading-7 text-slate-700">You agree not to:</p>
      <ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 leading-7 text-slate-700">
        <li>Use the Service for any unlawful purpose or to violate any applicable law.</li>
        <li>Use the Service to process material you do not have the right to use.</li>
        <li>Attempt to disrupt, overload, or gain unauthorized access to the Service or related systems.</li>
        <li>Use automated means to scrape or overload the Service.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">4. No warranty</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 leading-7 text-slate-700">
        The Service is provided "as is" and "as available" without warranties of any kind, express or implied,
        including but not limited to warranties of accuracy, results, reliability, or fitness for a particular purpose.
        We do not warrant that the Service will be uninterrupted or error-free, or that output files will meet your requirements.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">5. Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 leading-7 text-slate-700">
        To the maximum extent permitted by law, {siteName} and its operators shall not be liable for any indirect,
        incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages, or any loss of data or profits, arising out of or related
        to your use of the Service — even if advised of the possibility of such damages. Because files are processed
        locally, any loss or corruption of your files is your responsibility; always keep backups.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">6. Intellectual property</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 leading-7 text-slate-700">
        The Service's design, brand, and code are the property of {siteName}. You may not copy, modify, or redistribute the
        Service without permission. Files you process remain your property; we never claim any rights to your content.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">7. Advertising</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 leading-7 text-slate-700">
        The Service displays advertisements to cover operating costs. Advertisements are provided by third parties and do not
        affect the local processing of your files.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">8. Changes and termination</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 leading-7 text-slate-700">
        We may modify, suspend, or discontinue any part of the Service at any time without notice. We may also change these
        Terms; continued use after changes constitutes acceptance.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">9. Governing law</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 leading-7 text-slate-700">
        These Terms are governed by the laws applicable in the jurisdiction where the Service operator is located,
        without regard to conflict-of-law principles.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">10. Contact</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 leading-7 text-slate-700">
        For questions about these Terms, please visit our <a href="/contact/" class="text-brand-600 underline decoration-brand-200 underline-offset-2 hover:text-brand-700">contact page</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>